WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Inspect the source record
Illustrative AIO record: review the correction before publishing.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Choose a separate destination
Replay leaves the original record unchanged.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Describe the JSON correction
This sample changes /status to ready; review production writer mappings separately.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Preview before sending
Inspect original and destination bytes. Preview publishes nothing.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Confirm and apply once
Type the exact destination. Never blindly retry an uncertain write.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the acknowledgement
The receipt proves Kafka accepted the write, not consumer processing.
